//? Title: Stable mark-compact object-slot modeling
//? Subtitle: Actual shared marking, complete forwarding and field/root relocation
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
A compacting collector needs both liveness and a consistent address translation
for every surviving reference. This native unit-slot model computes stable dense
forwarding and rewrites survivor fields and roots. We retain the original
ten-slot even-id chain, expose actual producing phases, and distinguish modeled
slot relocation from physically moving or freeing C++ objects.
)

\toc

> Tiny actual forwarding and field translation

First mark every object reachable from the roots. Scan old slots in increasing
order, assigning each live object the next dense new slot and assigning
unreachable objects minus one. Only after this complete forwarding map exists,
translate every field of every live owner and every original root through the
same map. Because reachability is closed under references, each live owner’s
referenced target is also live.

For four old slots with root0 and links0-to2-to3, old slot1 is unreachable. The
stable map is old0-to-new0, old2-to-new1 and old3-to-new2. The actual original
field0-to2 becomes new0-to1. The table and diagram show the real forwarding scan
and the first actual field rewrite, not an inferred mapping produced by a second
collector run.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/mark_compact_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    dm::algorithms::ObjectGraph g{4, {{2}, {}, {3}, {}}, {0}, {}};
    auto t = dm::algorithms::mark_compact_trace(g);
    std::print("| actual old slot | actual live mark | next slot before | actual assigned slot or minus1 | " "next slot after |\n| ---: | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (auto &f : t.forwarding)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", f.object, f.live,
                   f.next_before, f.assigned, f.next_after);
    auto &r = t.references.front();
    dm::graphics::Diagram d;
    d.node("old", {0, 0},
           std::format("Actual original field\nold{} to old{}", r.owner_old,
                       r.target_old)).node("map", {6, 0},
                                           std::format("Actual completed forwarding\nold{} to new{}",
                                                       r.target_old,
                                                       r.target_new)).node(
        "new", {12, 0},
        std::format("Actual rewritten field\nnew{} to new{}", r.owner_new,
                    r.target_new)).edge("old", "map").edge("map", "new");
    d.save_svg("build/mark_compact_tiny.svg");
}
```
